      FiniteFieldOrthogonalUnitaryTI.unitary_card_lower_bound hcard hstar n,
    by simpa only [Nat.card_eq_fintype_card] using
      Mathproof.Problem18ClassicalOrbitBoundary20260930.unitary_card_upper_bound hcard hstar n⟩
