        ⟨⟨⟨trivial, hNl⟩, ⟨hNl, hNl⟩⟩, ⟨⟨⟨hcl, trivial⟩, hul⟩, hNl⟩⟩
        hSτ hD hSrc hNτ (by omega) (by omega)
