    chosen_run_canonical (F:=F) q q_valid basisCount gatherIndex gatherSource gatherDestination
      (by intro x hx; simp only [List.mem_cons,List.not_mem_nil,or_false] at hx
          rcases hx with rfl|rfl|rfl|rfl <;> repeat' constructor <;> decide)
      (by decide) h.slots hN hc hcN hprefixfit
