namespace Mathproof.Problem18BoundedComputedPreprocessing20261001
open scoped BigOperators
open Matrix Problem18EliminationKernelFamily20261001 Problem18PolynomialCompression20261001
  Problem18ArrayElimination20260929 Problem18BoundedEncoding20260930
  Problem18BoundedEncodingMatrixCorrectness20260930 Problem18BoundedKernelGramBridge20260930
