namespace Mathproof.Problem18BoundedDenseReduction20261001
open Problem18BoundedEncoding20260930 Problem18ExpressionCoefficientBackend20261001
  Problem18QuantifiedFormulaElimination20261001 Problem18QuantifierElimination20261001
