      Slots F canonical names.q.WS S B τ ∧
      (∀u (hu:u<ps.length) (j:Fin (boundedExponents n d).length),
        val F canonical names.q.WS τ (o+u*(boundedExponents n d).length+j.val)=
          read (evaluateTemplate (Int.castRingHom K)
