    (interpret (Int.castRingHom (fixedField d.automorphism))
        (Sum.elim (Problem18P34Frontend20261003StarTemplates.values F d z) (coordinateAssignment F d x))
        (Problem18P34Frontend20261003StarTemplates.compile p).1=0 ∧
     interpret (Int.castRingHom (fixedField d.automorphism))
        (Sum.elim (Problem18P34Frontend20261003StarTemplates.values F d z) (coordinateAssignment F d x))
        (Problem18P34Frontend20261003StarTemplates.compile p).2=0) ↔
